#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:1 d16d44abbe4d4a83bab9d6a3d222a3c2
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "Architecture"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:3 ccf75ee2cf1944369d2f25afd491464f
msgid ""
"A Python taxonomy-memory core emits traceable candidate records for human "
"review and optional persistence."
msgstr ""
"Un noyau Python de memoire taxonomique emet des dossiers candidats tracables"
" pour revision humaine et persistance optionnelle."

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:5 4b7d592dee1f48658be1022f37801274
msgid "Data flow"
msgstr "Flux de donnees"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:11
#: bb172582473e4e059a5197339273f85e
msgid "Provenance"
msgstr "Provenance"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:13
#: bb7ef8de0af8491286f8c49dbe0ef1f3
msgid ""
"Record the repository commit, configuration, input identifiers, execution "
"command, output location, and validation result. A screenshot alone is not a"
" reproducible artifact."
msgstr ""
"Consignez le commit du depot, la configuration, les identifiants d'entree, "
"la commande d'execution, l'emplacement de sortie et le resultat de "
"validation. Une capture seule n'est pas un artefact reproductible."

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:15
#: 9d1023649b2b4e3dbb39362d70418c18
msgid "Failure behavior"
msgstr "Comportement en cas d'echec"

#: ../../docs/tools/synthia/architecture.md:17
#: 3574e61a709742fca5b778071ee2ef87
msgid ""
"Missing configuration, unavailable dependencies, invalid input, and failed "
"tests must remain visible. The tool must not replace a failure with invented"
" success."
msgstr ""
"Une configuration absente, des dependances indisponibles, une entree "
"invalide et des tests echoues doivent rester visibles. L'outil ne doit pas "
"remplacer un echec par un succes invente."
